    "topic": "Who doesn't love a good visual web mangovel? Whether your taste is for daily one-off webcomics, for fixed-start-and-end stories told in ink and paper, or for knowing 50 years of lore just to understand that one panel on page 32 of the latest issue, come here to let others know about it!\n\nThis channel is for general discussion of any graphic novels, manga, and similar visual literature. Any series or one-shot is welcome to be discussed, but all spoilers _must_ be hidden behind spoiler tags. Put two bars, | | (without the space in between), on either side of the spoiler text to produce hidden text ||like this||.\n\nIf you want to discuss spoilers without using spoiler tags, then start a new thread for that specific book/series (or use an existing thread if there is one) in the book threads forum.\n\nIntentionally spoiling something for others is highly inconsiderate and grounds for suspension.",
